  "name": "Spinach and Feta Pita Bake",
  "subtitle": "Crisp whole-wheat pitas with pesto, greens, vegetables, and cheese",
  "description": "Bake pesto-spread pitas with spinach, tomatoes, mushrooms, and two cheeses for a quick Greek-inspired main dish.",
